cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or the derived corpus in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "audit_engagement_kit"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit and reproducible corpus for collecting A-share auditor
  engagement announcements from CNINFO (2020-2026), reconstructing the PDF
  layout of the "project information" section, and extracting engagement
  partners, signing certified public accountants, quality control reviewers,
  and four career time nodes, yielding a SQLite dataset with FTS5 full-text
  search and Excel exports.
authors:
  - name: "audit_engagement_kit contributors"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - auditing
  - auditor engagement
  - A-share market
  - CNINFO
  - annual report
  - PDF layout extraction
  - corpus
  - Python
